| State                | Appearance                               |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Unseen               | Prominent brand-gradient ring            |
| Seen                 | Muted neutral ring                       |
| Your active Vibe     | Profile avatar with management indicator |
| No active Vibe       | Create Vibe indicator                    |
