### 5.3 Feed behavior

* Prioritize relevant active Vibes.

* Show the user's own Vibe first.

* Group multiple Vibes from the same person.

* Avoid duplicate user entries.

* Distinguish unseen and previously seen Vibes.

* Remove expired Vibes from active results.

* Update the feed after publishing.

* Handle deleted or unavailable content gracefully.

* Maintain scroll position when returning from the viewer.

* Support pagination when the feed grows.

The initial feed should load quickly without waiting for every media file to download.

