Part 1 may implement basic highlight creation and management if the existing profile architecture supports it without significant scope expansion.

Otherwise, preserve the required data and integration contracts for a later phase.

Highlight capabilities should include:

* User-selected archived Vibes.

* Highlight title.

* Cover selection.

* Add or remove Vibes.

* Delete highlight.

* Access through the appropriate profile interface.

Do not introduce cover photos for user profiles as part of this feature.

### 13\. Vibes management controls

